<section aria-labelledby="what-h">
  <h2 id="what-h" class="type-h2">What Arche is</h2>
  <p>Arche is the system my personal brand runs on. It has a token layer (color, type, spacing, motion), a set of components built on those tokens, and the rules for using both. It supports light and dark mode and meets WCAG AA.</p>
  <p>It started as the design system for my portfolio site, and it is written so other designers and teams could use it. This site is its documentation. Every color, size and contrast ratio on these pages is read from the same token file the system is built from, so the docs cannot drift from the product.</p>
